OL,3,GNEWSA'Expect police attention if you're
OL,4,Awearing a balaclava on a sunny day'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe chief constable of West Midlands
OL,7,FPolice has warned that anyone wearing a
OL,8,Fbalaclava on a sunny day can expect to
OL,9,Freceive police attention.
OL,11,FScott Green was appointed as the
OL,12,Fforce's permanent chief constable in
OL,13,FSeptember, having served as interim
OL,14,Fchief constable following the departure
OL,15,Fof Craig Guildford in January.
OL,17,FGreen was speaking as part of a hot
OL,18,Fseat on BBC Radio WM, where anti-social
OL,19,Fbehaviour was a recurrent theme of
OL,20,Flisteners' questions.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
